00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:41.940
There are so many moons in the background of some of these stages and they're massive moons.

00:21:42.120 --> 00:21:45.720
They're not like leftover material from the construction site.

00:21:46.040 --> 00:21:51.580
I have to imagine social on because it's like, they're not even like, oh, like little stars in the different distance.

00:21:51.720 --> 00:21:57.660
Cause they give you those. They have like some white pixels in the background to be the stars, but then they have giant moons too.

00:21:57.660 --> 00:22:00.200
