00:23:43.040 --> 00:23:47.880
But if you're on launch fist two and you collect fireballs, now you're on fireballs one.

00:23:48.080 --> 00:23:51.300
Yeah. You're going to spend a lot of time in this game avoiding pickups.

00:23:52.140 --> 00:23:59.040
