Sean, thinking about essential game Terra Cresta, what's, what makes that one of our essential games is that as you're building up to the ultimate final form of your ship, the Phoenix, which is just, as we talked on the podcast, just so cool and invincible.

00:25:28.480 --> 00:25:37.640
Along the way, though, you are progressing and feeling great about the power ups that you're gaining on the road to the final form.

00:25:37.640 --> 00:25:41.340
On this one, I don't know if just like saying like, okay, cool.

