Thanks, Mike. And so if anything we talked about wasn't entirely too interesting, or maybe it was interesting, and you're like, oh, sign me up for being a giant dinosaur that then gets small, or sign me up for Flash-like stages, know that this is what you do over and over again with very subtle differences.

